[en.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_ZEBRA]
Conquer the Zebras

[en.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_ZEBRA_desc]
In the southern jungle of the Changeling Empire, Farasi has been waging a guerrilla war with the Changeling Empire, hindering the expansion of the Changeling Empire. Therefore, it is necessary to pay attention to the war against the Zebras and strive to solve the southern problem thoroughly. However, does the Changeling Empire, which has always been dominated by raids and large-scale battles, really have the confidence to win in a long-lasting guerrilla war?

[zh.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_ZEBRA]
对斑马的征服

[zh.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_ZEBRA_desc]
在幻形灵帝国南部丛林中，法拉希在持续和幻形灵帝国进行着游击战，阻碍着幻形灵帝国扩张的步伐，因此有必要重视对斑马的作战，争取彻底解决南方问题。不过，向来以突袭和大规模战斗为主的幻形灵帝国，真的有信心在一场旷日持久的游击战中取得胜利吗？

